---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="LK 810 Loading Unit | Smokeless Heat" description="LK 810 loading unit for wood and pellet boiler systems with thermal storage.">
  <Header />

  <main class="pt-24 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-4 text-sm text-charcoal/60">
      <a href="/" class="hover:text-ember">Home</a> / 
      <a href="/products" class="hover:text-ember">Products</a> / 
      <a href="/products/heating-accessories" class="hover:text-ember">Heating Accessories</a> / 
      <span class="text-charcoal">LK 810 Loading Unit</span>
    </div>

    <section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-8">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-start">
        <div>
          <img src="/images/lk-810-loading-unit.jpg" alt="LK 810 Loading Unit" class="w-full max-w-sm border border-wood/10" />
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-sm text-ember mb-2">Heating Accessories</p>
          <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl text-darkwood">LK 810 Loading Unit</h1>
          
          <div class="mt-4">
            <span class="text-2xl font-medium text-darkwood">Call for pricing</span>
          </div>
          
          <p class="mt-2 text-charcoal/70">Compact loading unit for solid fuel boiler and thermal storage systems.</p>

          <a href="tel:8553890083" class="inline-block mt-6 bg-ember text-cream px-6 py-3 text-sm uppercase tracking-wide font-medium hover:bg-wood transition">
            Call to Order: 855-389-0083
          </a>

          <div class="mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-wood/10 text-sm text-charcoal/70">
            <span><strong>Categories:</strong> Heating Accessories</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 border-t border-wood/10">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-darkwood mb-6">Description</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4 text-charcoal/90 leading-relaxed">
        <p>The LK 810 is an automatic loading unit for solid-fuel boiler/storage tank installations.</p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 mt-4">
          <li>Makes the boiler reach an optimum operation mode faster, which means less environmental impact</li>
          <li>Ensures a constant minimum return temperature into the boiler, which increases boiler efficiency, prevents tarring, and considerably prolongs the lifetime of the boiler</li>
          <li>An automatic balancing valve closes the by-pass loop in the end phase of the firing time to ensure maximum supply of hot water from boiler to storage tank</li>
          <li>Eliminates the risk of destructive thermal shock caused by surges of cold return water</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-4">Available with or without backflow preventer. With the backflow preventer, the LK 810 automatically allows self-circulation after the fire has gone out so residual heat in the boiler is transferred into the storage tank.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-10 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div>
          <iframe class="w-full aspect-video" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/DCLTvd4lo1U" title="LK 810 ThermoMat with Check Valve" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen></iframe>
          <p class="text-sm text-wood mt-2">LK 810 ThermoMat with Check Valve</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <iframe class="w-full aspect-video" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/PIC_ZpS73QY" title="LK 810 ThermoMat without Check Valve" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen></iframe>
          <p class="text-sm text-wood mt-2">LK 810 ThermoMat without Check Valve</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-8 border-t border-wood/10">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-darkwood mb-4">Downloads</h2>
      <a href="/images/LK_Brochure.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-ember hover:underline">
        <span>LK Armatur Brochure (PDF)</span>
      </a>
    </section>

    <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-8 border-t border-wood/10">
      <p class="text-sm text-charcoal/60">Legacy product. Contact Smokeless Heat for availability or technical support on existing systems.</p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
